the UE, in 5GMM-IDLE mode over 3GPP access, has uplink user data pending (except in case j);

the UE, in 5GMM-CONNECTED mode or in 5GMM-CONNECTED mode with RRC inactive indication, has user data pending due to no user-plane resources established for PDU session(s) used for user data transport;

the UE in 5GMM-IDLE mode over non-3GPP access, with T3346 not active or upon expiry of T3346, receives or has already received an indication from the lower layers of non-3GPP access, that the access stratum connection is established between the UE and the network;

the UE, in 5GMM-IDLE mode over 3GPP access, receives a notification from the network with access type indicating 3GPP access when the UE is in 5GMM-CONNECTED mode over non-3GPP access;

